# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
/target/

# Generated by Tauri
# will have schema files for capabilities auto-completion
/gen/schemas

# Staged FFmpeg runtime DLLs bundled into the installer by `tauri build`
# (see tauri.conf.json's bundle.resources) — copied here manually from the
# FFmpeg SDK install (see CLAUDE_SESSIONS.md), not something to commit.
/ffmpeg-bin/

# Same idea as /ffmpeg-bin/ above, for the official Visual C++
# Redistributable installer bundled into the app installer (see
# nsis-hooks.nsh's NSIS_HOOK_POSTINSTALL) — a redistributable binary from
# Microsoft, not something to commit; see README.md for where to get it.
/vcredist/

